        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- Probationary employees will not be placed in the Absence Monitoring Program. The status of their employment is governed by the CBA. If an employee completes their probationary period, the absences they incurred while in the probationary period will be reviewed for inclusion in the program under the provisions stated below.",
