        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• If an employee is not covered by FML (either because they have less than a year of service, worked less than 1,250 hours in the previous year or they used their 12 weeks of FML during the previous 12 month rolling period), the FML standard will be used to determine inclusion in the program. The process provided in this paragraph will be revisited at the end of 2001.",
