        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The purpose of this letter is to confirm that the parties have agreed that for the purpose of this contract, dated December 3, 2000 only, that in February 2004 all Local #80 refirees who retired prior to January 1, 1995, will receive a COLA adjustment on their pension benefits retroactive for the year 2001. This 2001 COLA adjustment will be calculated in the same manner as the previously negotiated three-year retroactive COLA adjustments and will not exceed 3%.",
